upd("n612", append="[Checked in Badius 1518 via SCTA: *Quodl.* V q. 1 asks ‘vtrum pluralitas & distinctio attributorum essentialium accipienda sit penes respectum … ad creaturas: an … ad aliquid intra’. Verified. *Quodl.* XIII q. 1 is on the vision of God by the blessed. It touches the attributes as distinct only ‘secundum rationem … secundum rationes attributales’, so it is a related passage, not a treatment of the question.]", status="verified")
